# Octane UI (`apps/web`)

- Prefer `.tsrx` with `function Comp() @{ … }`. Do not mix `return (` JSX with `@if` / `@{`.
- Control flow: `@if` / `@else` only (no `@else if`); `@for (…; key …)`; `@switch`.
- Text inputs: `onInput` + `value`. Not React synthetic `onChange` for per-edit typing.
- Server/session data: `@octanejs/tanstack-query` via `src/lib/session-queries.ts` and cache helpers. Local `useState` for forms only.
- Auth forms: `method="post" action="#"`, submit controls `type="button"` when handling in JS.
- Bindings: use existing `@octanejs/*` packages. Do not alias `react` → Octane.
- Before commit: `make web-lint` + `make web-format-check` (type-aware oxlint / oxfmt via `@tsrx/oxc`).
- Full skill: `.agents/skills/octane/SKILL.md` · reference: https://octanejs.dev/llms.txt
